@startuml US_3_2_2_C4_Processos
title US 3.2.2 - Processo de role-binding

actor SPA
participant API as "/api/auth/role"
database DB as "PortContext"

SPA -> API: GET /api/auth/role (cookie)
API -> DB: find AppUser by email/sub
DB --> API: user + active roles
alt sem role ativo
  API --> SPA: 403 {message}
  SPA -> SPA: limpar auth_token; negar navegação
else roles encontrados
  API --> SPA: {roles:["Admin",...]}
  SPA -> SPA: normalize roles; salvar; atualizar menu
end

@enduml
